.TH TCLSH 1
.SH NAME
tclsh \- Tcl shell
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tclsh
.RI [ arg ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Tclsh
is a front end onto this tree's own Tcl interpreter
.RI ( tcl_core.b
and its companion
.B tcl_*
library modules): it reads lines from standard input, evaluates each
as a Tcl command, and prints a
.B tcl%
prompt between commands. Any
.I arg...
is passed through to the Tcl core's own initialization.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/cmd/tclsh.b
